& [ObservedDesignPressure] is structured model wire output plus deterministic host compilation
  + open free-text output consumed disproportionate tiny-model capacity and produced low-information repetition
  + finite semantic IDs enums exact lengths and host-derived identity bindings reduced the public generation surface
  + the model chooses provisional identities ordering and relation kinds while the host owns membership identity boundary graph and latch gates
  + the compiled account states what transform occurred and does not pretend the host invented a model explanation
  + request parsing semantics require their own profile identity because changing a compiler can change replay disposition even when the prompt bytes do not change

& [EvidenceBoundary] is empirical design input rather than retroactive authority
  = must: preserve failed and successful reports together
  = must: process this observation through SJS before treating the typed wire compiler as canonical refinement
  = must: keep admitted_for_attention distinct from truth correctness authorization or production trust
  - never: infer broad tiny-model reliability from one field one model or one campaign
  - never: treat a deterministic compiled chain as proof that the chosen relation kinds are semantically correct
